# Wolfgangsee surface (hazard): a rounder, slower lake swell than the
# Salzach (period 16, 4 px per frame), bright turquoise t with s crests,
# a drifting w sparkle and an s reflection streak, then the t/T dither band
# (2 px, art-style 6) and flat T. Rows 6-15 are the same in every frame, so
# the jetty tile shows the same water under its deck.
sprite = tile_wolfgangsee_water
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = idle frames=4 ticks=12 loop
